<title>DENMARK: Moeller deny Estonia bid rumour.</title>
<headline>Moeller deny Estonia bid rumour.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish shipping and energy group A.P. Moeller denied on Monday media reports that it had bid for Estonian Shipping.</p>
<p>&quot;We are not interested in Estonian Shipping,&quot; a Moeller spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>According to some Nordic press and agency reports, Moeller's Maersk Line was among 19 companies that had placed bids for 70 percent of state-owned Estonian Shipping when the deadline for takeover offers expired last Thursday. --Uffe Hansen, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
